# Chat frontend environment
#
# Deployed backend origin. REQUIRED for any hosted deployment (Vercel etc).
# Vercel is static hosting and cannot run the Express + socket.io backend, so
# the API must be deployed separately (Render, Fly, Railway, ...) and named here.
#
# Local dev does not need this file: on localhost the app auto-targets
# http://localhost:5500.
#
# Vite inlines VITE_* variables at BUILD time, so after changing this you must
# redeploy/rebuild -- editing the variable alone does not affect an existing build.
VITE_API_URL=https://your-chat-backend.onrender.com
